OL,3,GNEWSANew restrictions on walking dogs
OL,4,Aoff leads
OL,5,
OL,6,FDog walkers could face a fine for
OL,7,Fletting their pets off the lead in more
OL,8,Fof a city's green spaces under new
OL,9,Frules.
OL,11,FPublic Spaces Protection Orders (PSPOs)
OL,12,Fon dog control have been voted in by
OL,13,Fmembers of Cambridge City Council to
OL,14,Fcover the nature reserves at Byron's
OL,15,FPool, Church End and Fulbourn Road.
OL,17,FThe new restrictions will apply between
OL,18,F1 March and 31 July to protect wildlife
OL,19,Fand breeding birds.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
