OL,3,GNEWSANew restrictions on walking dogs
OL,4,Aoff leads
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of restrictions already in
OL,7,Fplace across the city, some of which
OL,8,Frequire dogs to be on leads at all
OL,9,Ftimes, have also been extended for a
OL,10,Ffurther three years.
